function f1 name="read" module=m0 flags=[HasExplicitName] length=1 thisType={type=anything} parameters=[{type=undefined|null|string flags=[IsExpected]}] results=[{type=anything}] capabilities=[MayChangeSignature, MayBeCloned, MayBeInlined, HasOrdinaryFrame, IsNeverCalledByHost] {
  b0(v0: undefined|null|string):
    Jump -> next b1()
  b1():
    v1 = Builtin builtin=JSON
    v2 = PropGet v1 key="parse"
    v3 = Convert v2 declared={type=builtin(JSONParse) flags=[IsExpected]}
    v4 = Call v3, v1, v0 calleeKey="parse" calleeName="JSON.parse"
